From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:07:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 01/20] KITKAT-P1: Rebase Theme.DeviceDefault onto Theme.Holo

- 35 Material parents swapped for Holo across the DeviceDefault family
  (5 styles kept on Material for lack of Holo counterparts)
- DeviceDefault dark/light palettes rewritten to holo_blue_light/dark with
  black system bars, control colors, forceDarkAllowed=false
- config_dialogCornerRadius and config_buttonCornerRadius -> 0dp
- Status bar height 24dp -> 25dp
- Monet seed pinned to 0xFF33B5E5 in ThemeOverlayController so wallpaper
  colors never override the Holo palette in SystemUI
- Also lands the square battery perimeter (config_batterymeterPerimeterPath,
  Phase 2) and the kitkat-lock-clock family pointer (config_clockFontFamily,
  Phase 6) since they share config.xml

Change-Id: Ic5019b7a5669bf01543060606a340cd434c2db72
---
